<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>First Battle of Donetsk Airport, 2014</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WIDOWS: 1; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline !important; FONT: 14px/22px sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; FLOAT: none; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(37,37,37); WORD-SPACING: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;IMG style="WIDTH: 547px; HEIGHT: 335px" alt=http://ic.pics.livejournal.com/strannik_rf/50764207/63053/63053_original.jpg align=baseline src="http://ic.pics.livejournal.com/strannik_rf/50764207/63053/63053_original.jpg" width=743 height=433&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Date/Time:&lt;/STRONG&gt;&amp;nbsp;26 May, 2014&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Location: &lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = st1 ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;East Ukraine&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;Playable Sides:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/STRONG&gt;Ukrainian Air Force&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WIDOWS: 1; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline !important; FONT: 14px/22px sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; FLOAT: none; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(37,37,37); WORD-SPACING: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;26 May 2014 Ukrainian government started an anti-terrorist operation against pro-Russian insurgents in the Donetsk Oblast in early April 2014. Pro-Russian protesters and insurgents affiliated with the DPR&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WIDOWS: 1; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline !important; FONT: 14px/22px sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; FLOAT: none; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(37,37,37); WORD-SPACING: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;captured and occupied numerous government buildings, towns, and territories in the region. In Donetsk&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WIDOWS: 1; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline !important; FONT: 14px/22px sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; FLOAT: none; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(37,37,37); WORD-SPACING: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;city itself, many government buildings were under separatist control. Airport&lt;SPAN class=Apple-converted-space&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WIDOWS: 1; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline !important; FONT: 14px/22px sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; FLOAT: none; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(37,37,37); WORD-SPACING: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;remained outside of insurgent control.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WIDOWS: 1; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline !important; FONT: 14px/22px sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; FLOAT: none; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(37,37,37); WORD-SPACING: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WIDOWS: 1; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; DISPLAY: inline !important; FONT: 14px/22px sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; FLOAT: none; LETTER-SPACING: normal; COLOR: rgb(37,37,37); WORD-SPACING: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Author: Apollo&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
